	PRINTFORMDW After all, you're much too old to be \@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 ?wetting#\@\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 && DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2 ?%" and "%#\@\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2 ? messing#\@ a diaper.
